    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/3/83368.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 38,
    "turn_text": "Well, my goal, my ultimate goal is that we will build up the support to build and get a Congress that will pass a bill to restore the protections of Roe into law and President Joe Biden will sign it. But then let's take a step back. So I'm starting the, we're naming the fight for our reproductive freedoms tour and it'll begin on January 22nd, which is the 51st anniversary of the Roe v. Wade decision. And Katie, you know, I mean, you and I, I'm going to speak for you. I think I'm accurate. Most of our adult or our conscious lives, right? When we were able to be aware of what is happening in the world. Roe v. Wade was the law of the land.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_06",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
