    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/3/83368.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 51,
    "turn_text": "And I just think that it is meant to distract from the realities, which is this. And it's really basic and fundamental on one level. This is about taking freedoms away. The freedom to make decision about your own body. This is a question also of trust. I trust women. President Joe Biden trusts women to be able to know what is in their own best interest and then make good decisions. And by the way, and women trust us to know we're gonna protect and fight for their freedoms. But fundamentally, that is the issue. And I think there are many people who want to distract from that fundamental foundational issue. And I take it to a foundational issue in terms of this is one of the main principles upon which our country was founded.",
